<h2 id="solving">Solving</h2>
<p>Given a website that seems like a plain stock trading website.
<img src="/assets/img/post_images/fdd2d617235c48abaa03cd58c34f4652.png" alt="74801145c620d176fc339b8682b79e13.png" /></p>

