<ol>
  <li>The web application is based on Express.js.</li>
  <li>The server gave us cookies named <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">myself</code> with some gibberish string as the value</li>
</ol>

<p><img src="/assets/img/post_images/4e864b8c7d9246788f130f282f0008b7.png" alt="4cf7848fd6f6ba78099697a0d7a5d0ef.png" /></p>

