<p>Then, start <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">ngrok</code> that points to <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">localhost:1337</code>, still in our local machine.</p>
<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><table class="rouge-table"><tbody><tr><td class="rouge-gutter gl"><pre class="lineno">1
